Low poly and game ready model of realistic keyboard; 
Includes 2048x2048 .png textures; 
Consists of 1 object and 1 material. Each material includes UV, textures and maps; 
Textures and maps included: Diffuse, Normal, Specular, Glossy, Emission; 
Original file is .blend; 
Also includes Game ready Unity scene; 
Made in Blender 2.79;

- This 3D model was made in Rhinoceros 6.0 using images as reference and maximum dimensions of the product;

  - Previews of the product included;

  - Keyshot materials and textures included;

  - Units: mm

Notes:

  - Previews rendered in Keyshot 6.0. Please note that the studio scene and environment settings are not included.

  - I highly recommend that you download few of my free 3D models and test if they work well with your 3D software before making a purchase.

  - If you need other filetype please feel free to contact me.

Any feedback will be appreciated, Thank you for buying!

